<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>数学试卷</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "SimSun", "Songti SC", serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }
        .page-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 40px;
            max-width: 1600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .paper-page {
            width: 700px; /* Approximate A4 width */
            min-height: 950px;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px 60px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            position: relative;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .header-info {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .score-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .score-table td, .score-table th {
            border: 1px solid black;
            padding: 5px;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .question-item {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .options-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            margin-left: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .options-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-left: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .handwritten-answer {
            color: blue;
            font-family: "KaiTi", cursive;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-left: 5px;
        }
        .footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .sidebar-text {
            position: absolute;
            left: 10px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(-90deg);
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .dotted-line {
            position: absolute;
            left: 30px;
            top: 0;
            height: 100%;
            border-left: 1px dotted black;
        }
        .blank-line {
            display: inline-block;
            border-bottom: 1px solid black;
            min-width: 100px;
            text-align: center;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        sup {
            font-size: 0.7em;
            vertical-align: super;
        }
        sub {
            font-size: 0.7em;
            vertical-align: sub;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page-container">
    <!-- Page 1 -->
    <div class="paper-page">
        <div class="dotted-line"></div>
        <div class="sidebar-text">学校：__________________ 考号：__________________</div>

        <div class="header-info">满分：150分 &nbsp;&nbsp; 时间：90分钟</div>

        <table class="score-table">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 15%;">题号</td>
                <td>一</td>
                <td>二</td>
                <td>三</td>
                <td>四</td>
                <td>五</td>
                <td>总分</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>得分</td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="section-title">一、选择题：本大题共 15 小题，每小题 4 分，共 60 分。在每小题给出的四个选项中，恰有一项是符合题目要求的，请将正确选项的代号填入题后括号内。</div>

        <div class="question-item">
            1. 已知集合 $A=\{-1, 1\}$, $B=\{x|ax=1\}$, 若 $A \cap B = B$, 则 $a$ 的取值集合为 ( <span class="handwritten-answer">D</span> )
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. $\{1\}$</div>
                <div>B. $\{-1\}$</div>
                <div>C. $\{-1, 1\}$</div>
                <div>D. $\{-1, 0, 1\}$</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            2. 已知集合 $M=\{x|x^2+x=0\}$, 则 ( <span class="handwritten-answer">D</span> )
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. $0 \notin M$</div>
                <div>B. $\emptyset \in M$</div>
                <div>C. $-1 \notin M$</div>
                <div>D. $-1 \in M$</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            3. 已知集合 $A=\{b, c, d\}$, 则集合 $A$ 的子集共有 ( <span class="handwritten-answer">D</span> )
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. 5个</div>
                <div>B. 6个</div>
                <div>C. 7个</div>
                <div>D. 8个</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            4. 已知集合 $M=\{a, 2a-1, 2a^2-1\}$, 若 $1 \in M$, 则 $M$ 中所有元素之和为 ( <span class="handwritten-answer">C</span> )
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. 3</div>
                <div>B. 1</div>
                <div>C. -3</div>
                <div>D. -1</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            5. 已知集合 $A=\{1, a\}$, $B=\{a^2, 1\}$, 若 $A=B$, 则 $a$ 的值为 ( <span class="handwritten-answer">A</span> )
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. 0</div>
                <div>B. 1</div>
                <div>C. -1</div>
                <div>D. 0 或 1</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            6. 函数 $f(x)=\sqrt{2x-1}$ 的定义域为 ( <span class="handwritten-answer">A</span> )
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. $\{x|x \ge 1/2\}$</div>
                <div>B. $\{x|x > 1/2\}$</div>
                <div>C. $\{x|x \ge 0\}$</div>
                <div>D. $\{x|x > 0\}$</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            7. 下列函数中，在 $(0, +\infty)$ 上单调递增的是 ( <span class="handwritten-answer">B</span> )
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. $f(x)=-x$</div>
                <div>B. $f(x)=x^2$</div>
                <div>C. $f(x)=1/x$</div>
                <div>D. $f(x)=-x^2$</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            8. 已知函数 $f(x)=2x-1$, 则 $f(f(2))=$ ( <span class="handwritten-answer">B</span> )
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. 3</div>
                <div>B. 5</div>
                <div>C. 7</div>
                <div>D. 9</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            9. 函数 $y=(x-1)(x+5)$ 的单调递增区间是 ( <span class="handwritten-answer">B</span> )
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. $(0, +\infty)$</div>
                <div>B. $[-2, +\infty)$</div>
                <div>C. $(-2, 5)$</div>
                <div>D. $(-5, 1)$</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            10. 已知向量 $\mathbf{a}=(2, 1)$, $\mathbf{b}=(-2, 4)$, 则 $|\mathbf{a}-\mathbf{b}|=$ ( <span class="handwritten-answer">D</span> ).
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. 1</div>
                <div>B. 2</div>
                <div>C. 3</div>
                <div>D. 4</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">数学试卷 第1页（共4页）</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Page 2 -->
    <div class="paper-page">
        <div class="question-item">
            11. 已知向量 $\mathbf{a}=(1, \sqrt{3})$, $\mathbf{b}=(1, -\sqrt{3})$, 则 $|\mathbf{a}+\mathbf{b}|=$ ( <span class="handwritten-answer">B</span> )
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. 1</div>
                <div>B. 2</div>
                <div>C. $2\sqrt{3}$</div>
                <div>D. 4</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            12. 已知向量 $\mathbf{a}=(2, 1)$, $\mathbf{b}=(4, x)$, 若 $\mathbf{a} \parallel \mathbf{b}$, 则 $x=$ ( <span class="handwritten-answer">B</span> ).
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. 1</div>
                <div>B. 2</div>
                <div>C. -2</div>
                <div>D. -1</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            13. $\lg 8 + 3\lg 5$ 的值为 ( <span class="handwritten-answer">D</span> ).
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. -3</div>
                <div>B. -1</div>
                <div>C. 1</div>
                <div>D. 3</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            14. 已知 $\lg 2 = 0.301$, 则 $\lg 50 =$ ( <span class="handwritten-answer">A</span> ).
            <div class="options-grid">
                <div>A. 1.301</div>
                <div>B. 1.699</div>
                <div>C. 0.699</div>
                <div>D. 0.301</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            15. 不等式 $(x+2)(x-3) < 0$ 的解集是 ( <span class="handwritten-answer">C</span> )
            <div class="options-row" style="grid-template-columns: none; display: block;">
                <div style="display:inline-block; width: 45%;">A. $\{x|x < -2 \text{ 或 } x > 3\}$</div>
                <div style="display:inline-block; width: 45%;">B. $\{x|-2 < x < 3\}$</div>
                <div style="display:inline-block; width: 45%;">C. $\{x|x < 3\}$</div>
                <div style="display:inline-block; width: 45%;">D. $\{x|x > -2\}$</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">二、填空题：本大题共 10 小题，每小题 4 分，共 40 分。</div>

        <div class="question-item">
            16. 命题“若 $a>0$ 且 $b>0$, 则 $ab>0$”的逆否命题是 <span class="handwritten-answer blank-line" style="min-width: 250px;">若ab≤0，则a≤0或b≤0</span>.
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            17. 已知集合 $A=\{x|x \le 2\}$, $B=\{x|x > 0\}$, 则 $A \cap B =$ <span class="handwritten-answer blank-line">{x|0<x≤2}</span>.
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            18. 函数 $f(x)=x^3$ 的奇偶性为 <span class="handwritten-answer blank-line">奇</span>.
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            19. $8^{(2/3)}$ 的值为 <span class="handwritten-answer blank-line">4</span>.
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            20. $\log_2 8$ 的值为 <span class="handwritten-answer blank-line">3</span>.
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            21. 已知 $\sin \alpha = 3/5$, 且 $\alpha$ 为第一象限角，则 $\cos \alpha =$ <span class="handwritten-answer blank-line">4√5/5</span>.
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            22. 已知向量 $\mathbf{a}=(2, 3)$, $\mathbf{b}=(x, 6)$, 若 $\mathbf{a} \parallel \mathbf{b}$, 则 $x=$ <span class="handwritten-answer blank-line">4</span>.
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            23. 已知向量 $\mathbf{a}=(1, 2)$, $\mathbf{b}=(2, y)$, 若 $\mathbf{a} \perp \mathbf{b}$, 则 $y=$ <span class="handwritten-answer blank-line">-1</span>.
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            24. 已知函数 $f(x)=2x+1$, 则 $f(f(1))=$ <span class="handwritten-answer blank-line">7</span>.
        </div>

        <div class="question-item">
            25. 已知向量 $\mathbf{a}=(1, 1)$, $\mathbf{b}=(1, -1)$, 则 $2\mathbf{a}-\mathbf{b}=$ <span class="handwritten-answer blank-line">(1,3)</span>.
        </div>

        <div class="footer">数学试卷 第2页（共4页）</div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
